{
  "name": "dsh-error-firstaid",
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "description": "First aid for DeepSeek Harness errors: paste the error text and get the most likely cause plus one concrete step to try, from a curated deterministic rule table. No model call, no machine scanning, and an explicit \"I don't know\" when nothing matches. | 报错急救：粘贴报错原文，给出最可能的原因和一步能做的修复；规则表纯本地确定性匹配，不调模型、不扫机器，匹配不到就老实说不知道。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "SECURITY.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "troubleshooting",
    "error",
    "diagnose",
    "first-aid",
    "startup",
    "offline"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "Daphne999",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Daphne999/dsh-error-firstaid.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Daphne999/dsh-error-firstaid#readme",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.15"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test --test-isolation=none test/*.test.mjs",
    "smoke": "node test/smoke.mjs",
    "check": "node --check lib/index.js"
  }
}
